"""SHADOW VERIFIER -- deliberately SMALL and stdlib-only. NOT the experiment.

Supports (and is trusted for):
  * molecular formula parsing -> element census, heavy-atom count
  * average molecular weight from CIAAW-2021 abridged atomic weights (the HARD GATE)
