shadow_check.py (run): "analyzable molecules: 47 | formula<->SMILES heavy-atom agreement: 47/47 / all agree / unbalanced ring labels: 0". Negatives: NEG1 unrecognised chars, NEG2 empty, NEG3 unbalanced ring label, NEG5 unknown element; NEG4 "NOT shadow-detectable -> RDKit sanitisation is the required gate". MW anchors in DESIGN K1 (ethanol 46.069, aspirin 180.159, caffeine 194.194, glucose 180.156, eicosane 282.556, iodoform 393.732) match computed table; set MW n=47 min 46.07 max 393.73 median 132.12 mean 154.92 sd 81.39.

