     derivations rather than restating one. This lowers their transcription risk below what
     their size would otherwise imply -- but it validates atom counts only, NOT connectivity
     (see 7.2 and 8.4), which remains the residual limitation for C03/C04.
NOTHING WAS EXECUTED AS AN EXPERIMENT. No descriptor value in this document is an observation;
all remain pre-declared expectations awaiting a run in an RDKit-equipped environment.
"""
open('DESIGN.md','w').write(s)
